# Copy to ".env" (in this folder) and uncomment what you need.
# Everything here is OPTIONAL — the app runs with none of it set.

# ── AI tutor chat (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The step-by-step hint ladder always works without any of this. To enable the
# conversational tutor, pick ONE option below. Whichever you choose, the tutor
# gets the same scaffold-constrained system prompt and grading stays in the CAS.

# Option 1 — Free open model on Hugging Face (rate-limited free tier).
#   Token: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# TUTOR_PROVIDER=openai
# HF_TOKEN=hf_xxxxxxxx
# TUTOR_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
#   (math-specialized alternative: Qwen/Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct)

# Option 2 — Self-hosted model (free + private; student chat stays local).
#   e.g. Ollama:  ollama pull qwen2.5 && ollama serve
# TUTOR_PROVIDER=openai
# TUTOR_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# TUTOR_MODEL=qwen2.5

# Option 3 — Claude (paid; strongest guardrails). Auto-detected when set.
#   The KEY is read server-side only; it is NEVER sent to the browser. In
#   production set these as encrypted env vars in your host (e.g. Vercel) —
#   never NEXT_PUBLIC_*, never committed. See docs/tutor-anthropic-haiku-plan.md.
# TUTOR_PROVIDER=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxx
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5   # default; omit to use it, or set a larger model

# ── Admin usage dashboard (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Renders token usage + spend inside /admin. Needs an org-level Admin API key
# (sk-ant-admin…) — a SEPARATE, more privileged key than the tutor key above.
# Server-side only, admin-role gated; unset = /admin shows a Console link-out
# instead. See docs/tutor-usage-dashboard-plan.md.
# ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_KEY=sk-ant-admin-xxxx
# ANTHROPIC_TUTOR_WORKSPACE_ID=wrkspc_xxxx   # scope numbers to the tutor workspace

# ── Other (all optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://tutor:tutor@localhost:5432/algebra_tutor
# JWT_SECRET=            # auto-generated & persisted if unset
# PORT=3000
